Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Illogical, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever the enemy is, they're\Nusing a stand right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can clearly feel its presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But for some reason, the\Nstand user isn't in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can even sense them moving further away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If they were going to launch an attack\Non us, they'd have to move closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here, body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If the enemy's smart,\Nthey'll try to assassinate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,me while I'm vulnerable without my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My top priority is protecting my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Batman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Batman's right up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Frickin' sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't my body just stay still?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it even going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you see me right\Nin front of you, Weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be because you're\Nnot affected by its power?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave finding\Nmy body to me, Weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go after the enemy stand, user.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You cocky bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you waltz back over\Nhere after what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay put!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.27,0:03:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some officers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,By any chance, were you talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth and get the\Nhell away from my store!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, man. Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry, but I'm in\Nneed of some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you did to\Nmy store, you lunatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have a wife\Nto run this place with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I've been in here already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need more money,\NI'll give you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.88,0:03:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So please hang up the phone, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now which way did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who came in here\Nbefore was my twin brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there some kind of problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Unit 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have located a man who closely matches\Nthe description of the escaped convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you turn around and face us, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My body was still in the fucking\Nchocolate shop that whole time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need you to answer some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show us your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't no problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that old man run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver, drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I implanted chocolates\Nunder the skin of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming to you with an update.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have received word that\Nthe character Kenshiro
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,from one of Japan's many\Npopular animated series?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,has defeated the evil Rao in\Nthe streets of East Shinjuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It is an incident that reflects exactly\Nwhat happens in the original story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out right now! Yay! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess has awakened!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lovely Snow White\Nhas finally woken up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The geezer from the chocolate shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of being old and alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need my body anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My last days will be spent to\NSnow White's Prince Charming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my greatest Dream Country!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like the story!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the story!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the story? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you pay for\Ndevouring my brothers, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the shit is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did these things come out of the\Nchocolates I used in my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they goats or pieces of chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In the story, he's very devious.\NThe sly wolf managed to trick
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the seven young goats and entered\Ntheir house and once he was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,inside the ferocious fur monster\Nwent around capturing and devouring
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the young goats one by one the\Nonly one that survived was the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,youngest goat and only because\Nhe hid in the old grandfather
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Clock. This story I know. This one,\Nthe mother of the young goats came.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,back home to the slaughter and\Nwas very angry upon finding the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,big bad wolf she She took the\Nscissors and sliced his stomach open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Snip, snip!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She dragged out his intestines!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and proceeded to stuff him full of rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so he'd sink in the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough reading!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.04,0:06:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No more stories!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The wolf is the villain of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna make sure you\Npay for eating my BROTHERS!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get the enemy Stan's target!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was never after my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It wanted me to join the fantasy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've already been\Ndragged into a story!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Good day, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the right way\Nto San Reimi Hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are familiar with me, yes? I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm not from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So I couldn't help you\Neven if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, you've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean is you like me, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's written on your face\Nthat you enjoy my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You were moved by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself. I'm Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Van Gogh's self-portrait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just last night, with a razor\Nblade, I cut off my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.87,0:08:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see it in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You were moved by me, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.98,0:08:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And when she gets here, she's gonna\Nmake you pay with her scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You better believe when Mother\Nshows up, you'll be screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You want some of this, you bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're over here! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in here, Mama! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you gobble up my darling kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:08:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,More news on the fantasy hero stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.12,0:09:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The strange events, which first\Nstarted in Florida of the US,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,are no longer exclusively characters\Nfrom fantasy books and cartoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now seeing various works\Nof fine art coming to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Humankind's legacies, our\Nsociety's greatest treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,are vanishing before our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This damn stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,its sole purpose is protecting the priest,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and the user doesn't care if the\Nwhole world is collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and the stand itself is invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to defeat the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're moving north.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can sense them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where they're\Ngoing, but they're moving fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be in a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, young sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,how many self-portraits did he\Npaint over the course of his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.38,0:09:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me, or I'll kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the answer is approximately 40 it said he\Nleft them behind as a window into his soul
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,until he cut off his own ear and then when\Nhe reached the ripe age of 37 years old
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,he committed suicide by\Nshooting himself with a pistol
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a self-portrait as\Nwell aren't you the one of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,van gogh after he cut off\Nhis own ear What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the truth of it is he\Nshot two bullets into his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't die from the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the man needed one more bullet to put an\Nend to his pathetically miserable life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This enemy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.16,0:10:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to go north!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Block off the highway 30 kilometers\Nahead with a severe rainstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.54,0:11:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let any vehicles headed in\Nthat direction go any farther!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver Drive transformed the inner part\Nof the door and fused it into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's getting through this door now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.52,0:11:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver Drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My brothers are saved! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like the story!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way things can play out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means destroying these\Njacked-up goats is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the Wall Diver\NDrive! Phase through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the policemen from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess these guys got separated too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, I need to get\Ninside before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We need more rocks over here! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use! Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and kill the\Nfucking stand user already!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy presence that\NI felt heading north
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,just instantly started\Nmoving towards the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Flight 8250 to Key West\Nhas departed on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite thunderstorms,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we will arrive at our destination\Nin approximately 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This sick-ass new power that\Njust awakened in me is great,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and its only weakness is\Nif I get attacked directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But now nobody's gonna be able\Nto catch up to me on this plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What an awesome feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This sense of fulfillment's\Nreally getting me fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In reproduction,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to be born is also to be chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.30,0:13:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and the chosen one,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,even in their struggle against the other\Nsperms fighting for their chance of life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,is merely being raised up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and protected by the ones beneath them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The same can be said for those who\Nare drawn to me through destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,These individuals exist only to raise me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,up towards my true goal\Nof attaining heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Jolene Cujo has\Nescaped and is headed my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,she will just be another adversary for\Nme to step over on my path to ascension.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, sons of Dio,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you three shall protect me on our\Njourney to the land of Cape Canaveral.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be your reason\Nfor existing and your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,source of bliss until\Nthe end of your days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All I've done up till\Nnow is wander around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,aimlessly as my life\Nspiraled into a total mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and I had no idea why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But after today, I finally understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:14:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been existing through this\Nliving hell for this ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck drugs, I'll protect\Nthat priest with my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And the best thing that came out of\Nthis is my stand, Bohemian Ecstatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.74,0:14:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this new power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to watch the world that's\Ntreated me like shit slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,deteriorate as a society\Nfalls into chaos and despair!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If the enemy user is on a plane, it's\Nmoving more than 400 kilometers per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the largest hurricane recorded in\Nhistory only had a wind speed of 280.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not an atmospheric\Nphenomenon that can pursue the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When I get hit with a second bullet,\Nthe story will come to its end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare get any\Ncloser to that pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you even try touching\Nit, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Anesthesia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, shiiiit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.94,0:15:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The big bad wolf is gonna drown today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the star of you! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.80,0:15:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall honor your sacrifice by\Nliving a happy life in your stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,According to experts,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the countries with the\Nmost damages from this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,fantasy hero incident\Nare the United States...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you, Master Aladdin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you freed me, I will\Nbe your devoted servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With my power I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.24,0:15:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop mumbling to\Nyourself, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that book you're reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What more could you want from\Nme? Nothing. This is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a really talented artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you make him draw? Hallweather?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I had Van Gogh here put his skills\Nto work and create a hero for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a story too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Like most heroes, they have powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The power to defeat fantasy heroes\Nand return them all back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And this story can only end one way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With the hero bringing\Neverything back to reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna return just\Nlike the story describes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:17:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, there's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna return to\Nour bodies and hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I said hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.52,0:17:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, give me back my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming to you with an update.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears everything has\Nsuddenly returned to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All picture books, paintings,\Ncomics, and films have been restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mona Lisa, Snow White, Batman, and\Neven Tweety Bird have all returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet we have received reports that Pinocchio\Nhas not reverted to its original place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it too boring?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see how though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The story is so full of hope and fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what car are you\Ndriving around in these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You get a new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't driving the same\Ncar from before, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just help me, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of\Nplea bargaining before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Defendant Jolene Kujo is\Nsentenced to 15 years in... ROMEO!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I thought you were... But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Make this easy, Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere near the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Any phone for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.28,0:18:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day, I've\Nbeen regretting what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't forgive the sin\NI've committed against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After losing you the way I did, I\Nfinally realized just how stupid I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I swear to God, I'm\Nso sorry for betraying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you ever forgive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.14,0:18:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say a word, Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one in this world for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.97,0:18:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to visit you in jail,\Ntoo, but they didn't let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor, poor Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you always been this pitiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, just forget about the hit-and-run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't hate you, and\NI don't hold a grudge,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,now that I know the wreck was\Nall part of a plot against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Romeo, I came here because I\Nneed to ask you for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want some money and a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There is an important place I need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure, but I only have a grand on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And here, these are my\Nkeys. This is plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.36,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the police come by, don't\Nsay anything. Promise me. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I plan on turning myself in so\Nthat I can prove you were always innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, come back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome you got the keys to his car?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello yes my name is Romeo\NJazz and I live in Palm Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to report an escaped convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, her name is Jolene Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad I told\Nyou to plant one of my
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,stickers on that bendejo\Nand split it in two?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.03,0:20:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She never came to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling in to report because\NI just received a call from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She was begging for money,\Nbut I turned her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she said she\Nwas headed for Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If she calls again, I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well damn, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:21:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't betray you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If only she could forgive me one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.84,0:21:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ex is loaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think he gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure his car keys are\Nhere, but that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we really allowed to take that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to try steering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying the real thing must be Way different\Nfrom just reading about it in books.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Romeo, you've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's peel it off anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If we take the helicopter, we\Ncan get there in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.08,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.92,0:22:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.78,0:22:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.16,0:22:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.98,0:22:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.98,0:22:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:23:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,a distant dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,dreaming for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,all from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.66,0:23:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I understand that my\Nmission will be protecting you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, will\Nyou please open my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.06,0:23:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You see one of my eyelids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It keeps on drooping down,\Nand it doesn't go back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It only goes up sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.34,0:24:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
